window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v26-005-6035695098260d71.json"]={sha256:"6035695098260d711668430761f04c9aabd8c61eda337fe3d74cde636120b5ef",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v26-case-5688c819886494b2","url":"https://www.alcf.anl.gov/alcf-resources/mira","title":"Mira machine specifications","titleEn":"Mira machine specifications","publisher":"Argonne Leadership Computing Facility","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v26-005","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v26-005","related":[{"id":"hpc-v26-006","referenceUrls":["https://aics.riken.jp/en/k-computer/system.html"],"title":"K computer：SPARC64 SIMD 與稠密算術計帳","titleEn":"K computer: SPARC64 SIMD and dense arithmetic accounting","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付執行緒映射、有效FLOP帳與相同工作驗證；0.8與0.6重現且工作960不變；若答案誤差超教學1e−10即拒絕較快方案；請另一位學徒依交付件重新推導一組；未通過或資料不足必須明記，不以品牌或峰值取代證據。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver thread mapping, useful-FLOP accounting and equal-work verification. Reproduce 0.8 and 0.6 for fixed 960 work; reject the faster option if teaching error exceeds1e−10. Have another learner derive one case from the handover; label failures or missing evidence without substituting brand names or peak rates.","difference":"畫Cij=sum AikBkj，將乘法、加法與載入分開；不得把位元寬乘進FLOP數；524288與4194304一致，報告明示2n³是主項近似且輸出全覆蓋。","differenceEn":"Draw Cij=sum AikBkj and separate multiplies, adds and loads; bit width is not a FLOP multiplier. Verify both counts, identify 2 n³ as leading approximation, and cover every output.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["固定工作F的時間T=F/R，R是已量測的有效吞吐；不能以硬體執行緒倍數直接乘峰值；合成F=960百萬FLOP，一模式R=1200 MFLOP/s，另一模式R=1600；不含啟動；名義式 960/1200 = 0.8 s；變更式 960/1600 = 0.6 s。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","n×n矩陣乘法採每乘加2 FLOP的慣例，主項F=2n³；這是運算計數而非硬體發射數；合成n=64與128，忽略末項差異，固定雙精度與同一算法；名義式 2*64**3 = 524288 FLOP；變更式 2*128**3 = 4194304 FLOP。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["For fixed work F, time T=F/R uses measured useful throughput, not a hardware-thread multiplier on peak. Synthetic F=960 million FLOP; useful rates 1200 and 1600 MFLOP/s, excluding startup. Nominal 960/1200 = 0.8 s; changed 960/1600 = 0.6 s. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Square matrix multiplication uses leading count F=2 n³ when multiply-add counts as 2 FLOP; this differs from issued instructions. Synthetic n=64 versus 128, using leading-term counts with fixed FP64 and algorithm. Nominal 2*64**3 = 524288 FLOP; changed 2*128**3 = 4194304 FLOP. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v26-015","referenceUrls":["https://learn.arm.com/insights/sve/"],"title":"Arm SVE：向量長度無關的迴圈契約","titleEn":"Arm SVE: vector-length-agnostic loop contracts","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付執行緒映射、有效FLOP帳與相同工作驗證；0.8與0.6重現且工作960不變；若答案誤差超教學1e−10即拒絕較快方案；請另一位學徒依交付件重新推導一組；未通過或資料不足必須明記，不以品牌或峰值取代證據。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver thread mapping, useful-FLOP accounting and equal-work verification. Reproduce 0.8 and 0.6 for fixed 960 work; reject the faster option if teaching error exceeds1e−10. Have another learner derive one case from the handover; label failures or missing evidence without substituting brand names or peak rates.","difference":"畫37元素與不同lane群組；用不同顏色標出最後回合的無效位置；0.25/0.3125正確，37個結果逐項相同且尾端哨兵完好。","differenceEn":"Draw 37 elements grouped at both widths, coloring inactive tail positions. Verify both fractions, identical 37 outputs and intact tail sentinels.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["固定工作F的時間T=F/R，R是已量測的有效吞吐；不能以硬體執行緒倍數直接乘峰值；合成F=960百萬FLOP，一模式R=1200 MFLOP/s，另一模式R=1600；不含啟動；名義式 960/1200 = 0.8 s；變更式 960/1600 = 0.6 s。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","有效元素總數等於完整回合×L+尾數，任何VL都應同一N；最後述詞僅啟用剩餘元素；合成N=37個FP32元素，VL128時L4，VL512時L16；求最後回合有效比例；名義式 1/4 = 0.25 active-lane fraction in final iteration；變更式 5/16 = 0.3125 active-lane fraction in final iteration。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["For fixed work F, time T=F/R uses measured useful throughput, not a hardware-thread multiplier on peak. Synthetic F=960 million FLOP; useful rates 1200 and 1600 MFLOP/s, excluding startup. Nominal 960/1200 = 0.8 s; changed 960/1600 = 0.6 s. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Valid elements equal fullIterations×L+tail; every VL must cover the same N with only remaining lanes active. Synthetic N 37 FP32 values, L 4 at VL 128 and L 16 at VL 512; calculate final-iteration active fraction. Nominal 1/4 = 0.25 active-lane fraction in final iteration; changed 5/16 = 0.3125 active-lane fraction in final iteration. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v26-case-558463215b30fc63","url":"https://aics.riken.jp/en/k-computer/system.html","title":"System configuration of the K computer","titleEn":"System configuration of the K computer","publisher":"RIKEN AICS","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v26-case-cd8d917662ba45e3","url":"https://learn.arm.com/insights/sve/","title":"Arm SVE insights","titleEn":"Arm SVE insights","publisher":"Arm","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
